Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|test.run.environment|EE|
		|testray.main.component.name|Kaleo Forms Admin|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Workflow Definition|
	And Workflow upload Definition
		|workflowDefinitionFile|workflow_definition_xss.xml|
		|workflowDefinitionTitle||
	And Navigator open URL
	And Navigator open URL
	Then ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Kaleo Forms Admin|

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add Process
Priority: 4
	Given KaleoFormsAdmin add Process
	When KaleoFormsAdmin add Process Details
		|kfProcessDescription|Kaleo Forms Process Description|
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin next
	And KaleoFormsAdmin add Field Set
		|kfFieldSetName|New Kaleo Field Set|
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
	And DynamicDataMapping add Field
		|field|Text|
		|fieldFieldLabel|Text|
		|fieldName|Text|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin save Field Set
	And KaleoFormsAdmin choose Field Set
		|kfFieldSetName|New Kaleo Field Set|
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin next
	And these variables
		|key_rowEntry|alert|
	And Click at locator 'Icon#ROW_VERTICAL_ELLIPSIS'
	And AssertClick the value 'Choose' at locator 'KaleoFormsAdminEditProcess#WORKFLOW_MENULIST_CHOOSE'
	And KaleoFormsAdmin next
	And KaleoFormsAdmin assign Form
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
		|workflowTask|StartNode|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin add Form
		|kfFormName|Created Task Form|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin save Form
	And KaleoFormsAdmin choose Form
		|kfFormName|Created Task Form|
	Then KaleoFormsAdmin save Process
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|